        ],
        "CAPACITY_LEAD_TIME": [
          "manufacturing facility on October 3.",
          "Delays at Boeing, including a production slowdown after a door-sized panel blew off an airborne 737 Max plane in January, has forced Southwest to repeatedly cut the number of planes it expected to receive in 2024, settling at 20 jets."
        ],
        "TIMING": [
          "Southwest Airlines expects the strike by Boeing workers to limit the number of aircraft it receives next year.",
          "“It’s too early to tell, but I wouldn’t be surprised if our deliveries from Boeing in 2025 are lower than we originally thought,” Southwest chief executive officer Bob Jordan said in an interview on November 13."
        ]
