      "title": "Freight’s Next Cost Breakthrough Will Come From the Network",
      "url": "https://www.supplychainbrain.com/blogs/1-think-tank/post/44647-freights-next-cost-breakthrough-will-come-from-the-network",
      "source": "www.supplychainbrain.com",
