      "id": "c92659f9-3b3b-4766-8d4e-c8247afcecc0",
      "title": "Cadbury Cuts Two Months off its Supply Chain Lead Time in SE Asia",
      "url": "https://www.supplychainbrain.com/articles/44843-cadbury-cuts-two-months-off-its-supply-chain-lead-time-in-se-asia",
      "source": "www.supplychainbrain.com",
      "collected_at": "2026-09-30T22:02:08.777482+00:00",
